    <div style="background: #F3F4F6; padding: 25px; border-radius: 10px;">
        <h3 style="color: #1F2937; margin-bottom: 15px;">How it works:</h3>
        <ol style="color: #4B5563; line-height: 1.8;">
            <li><strong>Registration:</strong> The system captures your face for 5 seconds, extracting unique facial features and creating a mathematical descriptor.</li>
            <li><strong>Storage:</strong> Your facial data is securely stored locally on the server for future matching.</li>
            <li><strong>Recognition:</strong> When recognizing, the system compares live camera feed against registered users using advanced AI algorithms.</li>
